From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dugs <dugahol@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:43:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: input: apple,z2-multitouch: Add iPhone 8 Plus
 (D21)

The iPhone 8 Plus (D21, T8015) touch controller is a Z2 part of the
iPhone 7 Plus family (personality C1F5E, HBPP 0x103). Like the iPhone 7
Plus it takes a high-voltage supply (the Chestnut display PMIC switch,
ADT function-power_ana) and a core supply (an SMC function on this
board, ADT function-power_ldo), and runs in SPI mode 3.

Originally from iPhOmarchy patches/0020 ("input: apple-z2: D21 chestnut
touch-HV supply; PMIC + regulator + DTS", fb913fdd5f4f) and patches/0040
(b2533c59a2a0), iPhOmarchy 5921728.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml         | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
index b9d5dce04..c340a3cc6 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ properties:
       - apple,j172-touchscreen
       - apple,d11-touchscreen
       - apple,d111-touchscreen
+      - apple,d21-touchscreen
       - apple,n61-touchscreen
 
   interrupts:
@@ -239,6 +240,7 @@ allOf:
           enum:
             - apple,d11-touchscreen
             - apple,d111-touchscreen
+            - apple,d21-touchscreen
     then:
       required:
         - clocks
